		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Dryad queen, often kin of an erlking or other powerful faerie. Knows all that occurs within her forest domain.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 48, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 dagger +5 (1d4) or 2 longbow (far) +5 (1d8) or 1 charm or 1 healing touch, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Charm</strong>. Near, one creature, CHA 15+ or friendship for 1d8 days.</p><p></p><p><strong>Healing Touch</strong>. Touch heals 2d6 HP or ends one curse, disease, or poison.</p><p></p><p><strong>Meld</strong>. Step inside tree. May teleport far to another tree.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
